<title>JAPAN: Sekisui House - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui House - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		678.32		vs	  599.22</p>
<p> Operating	   44.43		vs	   39.38</p>
<p> Current	     40.14		vs	   38.11</p>
<p> Net		   21.41		vs	   20.70</p>
<p> EPS		   30.38 yen	  vs	   30.54 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    707 million	  vs	 678 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    9.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sekisui House Ltd is a major home builder.</p>
</text>
